Link: https://lore.kernel.org/qemu-devel/20260401080354.1347212-1-zhenzhong.duan@intel.com
Signed-off-by: Cédric Le Goater <clg@redhat.com>
(cherry picked from commit e2b7310276087351fadd6afbe9e5a3fff9c25f8d)
